speechtext:
It does seem to me that the minister is branching out to a very considerable extent when an expenditure of $44,000 is only a ' further amount required.'
I know that this includes working expenses of vessels. But surely the Public Works Department does not need to go into tlxe telegraph lines in the Maritime provinces and Lower St. Lawrence generally. We have telegraph and telephone lines everywhere;
I do not think you could find any place in New Brunswick ten miles away from a telephone. If there is any good reason for these government telegraph lines I should like to hear it.
